{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A grid space to clear your mind and create your own work. You can draw a floral path, a maze, a network of pipes, or some meaningless yet pleasing patterns\u2014anything you like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723280/extras/\u5c0f\u5ba3\u4f20\u56fe_EN__462x174.png?t=1748051828\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game has no objectives or true gameplay mechanics\u2014only connection and creation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Features included:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3010Map Canvas\u3011 A  grid space where you can click on each cell to fill or transform its content, generating continuously evolving tiles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3010Export Image\u3011 Export your grid space as an image to use as wallpaper, game assets, artwork, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3010Texture Packs\u3011 Plans to offer various texture packs, including not just flowers but also walls, houses, railways, and other world-building materials to choose from.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723280/extras/2.png?t=1748051828\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2723280?t=1748051828","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2723280?t=1748051828","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723280/c1d23278a8aa5a7a523e24670ee84d0000893588/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748051828","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723280/c1d23278a8aa5a7a523e24670ee84d0000893588/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748051828","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descript